SDL-E1008 (spec/README.md#design-rules-settled)

  x `sequence` takes no doc comment (no COMMENT clause)
   ,-[1:1]
 1 | /// invoice numbering
   : ^|^
   :  `-- no COMMENT clause on this statement
 2 | sequence invoice_number;
   `----
  help: `sequence` has no COMMENT clause in SurrealQL, so a doc comment has nowhere to attach — delete it or move it onto the definition above/below that takes one
